{c: Verse 1}
[D#] [F],        Bulave tujhe yaar ajj meri galiyan
[Gm] [F],        Basaun tere sang main alag duniya
[D#] [F],        Bulave tujhe yaar ajj meri galiyan
[Gm] [F],        Basaun tere sang main alag duniyaa
[D#] [F],        Na aaye kabhi dono me zara bhi faasle
