[D#] [F],        Hai mera sab kuchh tera tu samajh le
[Gm] [F],        Tu chaahe mere hakk ki zameen rakh le
[Cm] [F],        Tu saanson pe bhi naam tera likh de
[Gm] [Dm],        Main jiyun jab jab tera dil dhadke
[D#] [Cm],        Tujhse mera yeh jee nahi bharta
[D#] [Cm],        Kuchh bhi nahi asar ab karta
[Gm],        Meri raah tujhse, meri chaah tujhse
[Gm],        Mujhe bas yahin reh jaana
