[Gm] [F],        Hai tere bin pal bhi baras lagte,
[D#] [F],        Bulaave tujhay yaar aaj meri galiyan
[Gm] [Dm],        Basaun tere sang mai alag duniya.
[D#] [F],        Jo hove tu udas mujhe dekhe hass de
